"rich_text\"><h1 style=\"margin:0; font-size:30px; line-height:115%; text-align:center\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">Full-cycle infrastructure transaction data — built for how you actually work.</span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center; font-size:16px; line-height:125%; font-weight:normal\" align=\"center\">s</p></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<!--[if gte mso 9]></table><![endif]-->\n<!--[if (mso)|(IE)]></td><![endif]-->\n\n    <!--[if (mso)|(IE)]></tr></table><![endif]-->\n\n    </div>\n   \n  </div>\n  <div id=\"section_1757461318101\" class=\"hse-section\" style=\"padding-left:10px; padding-right:10px\">\n\n    \n    \n      <div class=\"hse-column-container\" style=\"min-width:280px; max-width:600px; margin:0 auto; background-color:#FBFBFA; padding-top:10px\" bgcolor=\"#FBFBFA\">\n    \n    <!--[if (mso)|(IE)]>\n      <table align=\"center\" style=\"width:600px;\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" bgcolor=\"#FBFBFA\">\n      <tr style=\"background-color:#FBFBFA;\">\n    <![endif]-->\n\n    <!--[if (mso)|(IE)]>\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"width:600px;padding-top:10px;\">\n<![endif]-->\n<!--[if gte mso 9]>\n  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:600px\">\n<![endif]-->\n<div id=\"column_1757461318101_0\" class=\"hse-column hse-size-12\">\n    <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" class=\"\" style=\"\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"hs_padded\" style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#23496d; word-break:break-word; padding:10px 30px 15px\"><div id=\"hs_cos_wrapper_module_175746123942239\" class=\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module\" style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit;\" data-hs-cos-general-type=\"widget\" data-hs-cos-type=\"module\"><div id=\"hs_cos_wrapper_module_175746123942239_\" class=\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_rich_text\" style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit;\" data-hs-cos-general-type=\"widget\" data-hs-cos-type=\"rich_text\"><p style=\"line-height:150%; text-align:left\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"color: #162331;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Hi there,</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:150%; text-align:left\" align=\"left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"color: #162331;\">If your work touches infrastructure, chances are your deal analysis still involves stitching together data from multiple sources, exporting to Excel, and rebuilding the same comp set every time. <span style=\"color: #49b065;\"><a href=\"https://greenstreet.com/products/infrastructure/?utm_source=hubspot&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=transactions-replatform&amp;utm_term=infrastructure&amp;utm_content=email-1\" style=\"font-weight:bold; color:#49b065\" rel=\"noopener\" data-hs-link-id=\"1\" data-hs-link-id-v2=\"/h6ddrPF\" target=\"_blank\">Green Street Infrastructure</a><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"> </span></span>was built to remove that step — and it just got a significant upgrade. </span></p></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<!--[if gte mso 9]></table><![endif]-->\n<!--[if (mso)|(IE)]></td><![endif]-->\n\n    <!--[if (mso)|(IE)]></tr></table><![endif]-->\n\n    </div>\n   \n  </div>\n  <div id=\"section_17897470844768\" class=\"hse-section\" style=\"padding-left:10px; padding-right:10px\">\n\n    \n    \n      <div class=\"hse-column-container\" style=\"min-width:280px; max-width:600px; margin:0 auto; background-color:#FBFBFA\" bgcolor=\"#FBFBFA\">\n    \n    <!--[if (mso)|(IE)]>\n      <table align=\"center\" style=\"width:600px;\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" bgcolor=\"#FBFBFA\">\n      <tr style=\"background-color:#FBFBFA;\">\n    <![endif]-->\n\n    <!--[if (mso)|(IE)]>\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"width:600px;\">\n<![endif]-->\n<!--[if gte mso 9]>\n  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:600px\">\n<![endif]-->\n<div id=\"column-1789747084476-0\" class=\"hse-column hse-size-12\">\n    <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" class=\"\" style=\"\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"hs_padded\" style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#23496d; word-break:break-word; padding:0px 29px 5px\"><div id=\"hs_cos_wrapper_module_17897470844756\" class=\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module\" style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit;\" data-hs-cos-general-type=\"widget\" data-hs-cos-type=\"module\"><div id=\"hs_cos_wrapper_module_17897470844756_\" class=\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_rich_text\" style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit;\" data-hs-cos-general-type=\"widget\" data-hs-cos-type=\"rich_text\"><h1 style=\"margin:0; font-size:36px; line-height:100%; font-weight:bold; text-align:left\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"color: #04504f; font-size: 22px;\">What's New?</span></h1></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n  <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" class=\"\" style=\"\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"hs_padded\" style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#23496d; word-break:break-word; padding:10px 30px 15px\"><div id=\"hs_cos_wrapper_module_17897470384601\" class=\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module\" style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit;\" data-hs-cos-general-type=\"widget\" data-hs-cos-type=\"module\"><div id=\"hs_cos_wrapper_module_17897470384601_\" class=\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_rich_text\" style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit;\" data-hs-cos-general-type=\"widget\" data-hs-cos-type=\"rich_text\"><p style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"color: #162331;\">The Transaction dataset covers 69,000+ transactions and $33.6 Trillion in total deal value across global infrastructure and energy sectors, going back nearly 30 years. As of this release, it also includes: </span></p>\n<ul style=\"line-height:150%\">\n<li style=\"color: #162331; line-height: 150%;\">\n<p style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color: #162331;\"><strong>Redesigned Transaction Page</strong> - 70+ data points (transaction details, financing structure (equity & debt), advisors, asset details) in one structured view</span><br><br></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"color: #162331; line-height: 150%;\">\n<p style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color: #162331;\"><strong>8 interactive charts</strong> - built directly into the platform, to aggregate and visualize deal data by region, sector, and deal type - no export required</span><br><br></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"color: #162331;\">\n<p style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"color: #162331;\"><strong>Customisable columns </strong>and saved views, <strong>multi-company search</strong>, and related assets nested under each transaction</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"color: #162331;\">If your firm has infrastructure exposure or is expanding into real assets, this is the dataset your deal analysis should be running on.</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:150%\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"color: #162331;\">Combined with independent infrastructure research and exclusive daily news coverage, it's the complete infrastructure suite in one place.</span></p></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<!--[if gte mso 9]></table><![endif]-->\n<!--[if (mso)|(IE)]></td><![endif]-->\n\n    <!--[if (mso)|(IE)]></tr></table><![endif]-->\n\n    </div>\n   \n  </div>\n  <div id=\"section_1785900709299\" class=\"hse-section\" style=\"padding-left:10px; padding-right:10px\">\n\n    \n    \n      <div class=\"hse-column-container\" st